    "['mpls rsvp-te', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'mpls traffic-eng', 'parent_command': ['mpls ip'], 'root': 'interface [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': '##\\nmpls traffic-eng\\nmpls traffic-eng signalling rsvp\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\n1. In Cisco, \"mpls rsvp-te\" from Huawei is equivalent to enabling both MPLS Traffic Engineering and RSVP signaling under the MPLS TE configuration.\\n2. The first command enables MPLS Traffic Engineering globally\\n3. The second command specifically enables RSVP as the signaling protocol for MPLS TE tunnels\\n\\nThese Cisco commands achieve the same functionality as Huawei\\'s single \"mpls rsvp-te\" command which enables both RSVP-TE capability and signaling.', 'trans_template': 'mpls traffic-eng'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'mpls traffic-eng signalling rsvp', 'parent_command': ['mpls ip'], 'root': 'interface [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': '##\\nmpls traffic-eng\\nmpls traffic-eng signalling rsvp\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\n1. In Cisco, \"mpls rsvp-te\" from Huawei is equivalent to enabling both MPLS Traffic Engineering and RSVP signaling under the MPLS TE configuration.\\n2. The first command enables MPLS Traffic Engineering globally\\n3. The second command specifically enables RSVP as the signaling protocol for MPLS TE tunnels\\n\\nThese Cisco commands achieve the same functionality as Huawei\\'s single \"mpls rsvp-te\" command which enables both RSVP-TE capability and signaling.', 'trans_template': 'mpls traffic-eng signalling rsvp'}]]": 1,
